{"title":"Career Roadmap · CAD Jewellery Modeller","role":"CAD Jewellery Modeller","summary":"A CAD Jewellery Modeller converts jewellery concepts, sketches, and design specifications into precise 3D digital models that can be rendered, prototyped, modified, and prepared for manufacturing. The role combines jewellery design, 3D modelling, gem setting knowledge, manufacturing constraints, precision, and digital fabrication.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Des (Bachelor of Design)","Course":"Jewellery / Accessory Design"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Stage","Approx. Timeline","Target"],"rows":[[{"text":"Foundation"},{"text":"Year 1"},{"text":"Jewellery design + drawing + materials"}],[{"text":"CAD Foundation"},{"text":"Year 2"},{"text":"3D modelling + jewellery structures"}],[{"text":"Advanced CAD"},{"text":"Year 3"},{"text":"Production-ready modelling + rendering"}],[{"text":"Industry Preparation"},{"text":"Year 4"},{"text":"Internship + manufacturing projects"}],[{"text":"Entry"},{"text":"0–2 years"},{"text":"Junior CAD Jewellery Modeller"}],[{"text":"Growth"},{"text":"3–6 years"},{"text":"CAD Jewellery Modeller / Senior CAD Designer"}],[{"text":"Mid Career"},{"text":"6–10 years"},{"text":"CAD Design Lead"}],[{"text":"Leadership"},{"text":"10–15 years"},{"text":"CAD/Design Manager"}],[{"text":"Long-term"},{"text":"15+ years"},{"text":"Jewellery Design Consultant / CAD Specialist / Entrepreneur"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to Build Each Year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Jewellery Design Foundation"},{"type":"p","text":"Build strong fundamentals in:"},{"type":"h","text":"Jewellery design"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Design principles"},{"text":"Proportion"},{"text":"Symmetry"},{"text":"Balance"},{"text":"Form"},{"text":"Ornamentation"},{"text":"Motif development"},{"text":"Design sketching"},{"text":"Jewellery terminology"}]},{"type":"h","tex